WEBVTT

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:14.160
Hold on. Hold on.

00:00:22.335 --> 00:00:23.920
-[dragon screeching]
-[grunts]

00:00:25.922 --> 00:00:27.381
Toothless!

00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:37.183
[growling]

00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:19.976
Hey! You left my dragon back there!

00:01:20.142 --> 00:01:22.478
He can't fly on his own! He will drown!

00:01:33.656 --> 00:01:34.824
[panting]

00:01:42.498 --> 00:01:43.916
[Hiccup grunts]

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.501
Hey!

00:01:46.168 --> 00:01:48.671
Uh, we have to head back for my dragon!

00:01:49.171 --> 00:01:50.423
[growling]

00:02:08.316 --> 00:02:09.984
[dragons groaning]

00:02:34.842 --> 00:02:36.302
Who are you?

00:02:37.303 --> 00:02:38.888
The dragon thief?

00:02:39.889 --> 00:02:40.931
Uh…

00:02:41.349 --> 00:02:42.850
Drago Bludvist?

00:02:44.226 --> 00:02:46.729
Do you even understand what I'm saying?

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.314
[rattles]

00:02:49.815 --> 00:02:51.442
[screeches]

00:02:53.819 --> 00:02:56.739
Toothless! It's okay,
it's okay, it's okay.

00:02:56.906 --> 00:02:58.908
I'm glad to see you, too, bud.

00:02:59.075 --> 00:03:02.119
-You really had me worried there.
-[Toothless grumbles]

00:03:38.698 --> 00:03:39.824
Uh…

00:03:39.907 --> 00:03:40.950
[gasping]

00:03:47.289 --> 00:03:48.416
[muffled] Hiccup?

00:03:48.874 --> 00:03:50.209
Uh…

00:03:53.379 --> 00:03:54.964
Could it be?

00:03:56.048 --> 00:03:58.426
After all these years?

00:03:58.801 --> 00:04:00.469
How is this possible?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.138
Uh, should I…

00:04:03.347 --> 00:04:04.765
Should I know you?

00:04:05.641 --> 00:04:08.436
No, you were only a babe.

00:04:13.899 --> 00:04:16.944
But a mother never forgets.

00:04:18.988 --> 00:04:20.030
[inhales sharply]

00:04:20.489 --> 00:04:21.824
[shushing]

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.995
Come.

00:04:26.954 --> 00:04:29.457
[Stoick] Boar-headed!
Just like his mother!

00:04:29.623 --> 00:04:31.459
Aye, she could never stay put either.

00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:32.918
[Gobber] He's just 20.

00:04:33.085 --> 00:04:36.213
And a Viking.
Could there be a worse combination?

00:04:36.338 --> 00:04:40.760
[scoffs] When I think of how stubborn
and senseless you were back in the day…

00:04:41.886 --> 00:04:43.345
Oh.

00:04:43.429 --> 00:04:45.973
Well, not much has changed, actually.

00:04:46.807 --> 00:04:49.101
[sighs] Ah, you know what he's like.

00:04:49.185 --> 00:04:50.936
He won't give up, Gobber.

00:04:51.771 --> 00:04:55.858
And if Hiccup finds Drago,
before we find him…

00:04:56.275 --> 00:04:57.526
Nothing can hurt Hiccup

00:04:57.651 --> 00:05:01.113
so long as that Night Fury's around.
It's a Night Fury!

00:05:04.617 --> 00:05:06.035
Huh?

00:05:11.373 --> 00:05:12.792
[grunts]

00:05:21.509 --> 00:05:23.302
Find them, Skullcrusher.

00:05:24.303 --> 00:05:25.387
Find them.

00:05:25.471 --> 00:05:26.555
[roars]

00:05:32.937 --> 00:05:34.480
Hold on. Wait just a minute.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.773
-This way!
-Come back here!

00:05:35.856 --> 00:05:36.899
Come.

00:05:36.982 --> 00:05:39.985
You can't just say
something like that and run off!

00:05:40.194 --> 00:05:42.571
You're my mother? I mean, what the…

00:05:43.072 --> 00:05:45.032
Do you grasp how insane it sounds?

00:05:45.282 --> 00:05:46.283
Come, quickly!

00:05:46.367 --> 00:05:48.494
I have questions! [grunts]

00:05:49.411 --> 00:05:51.372
Where have you been all this time?

00:05:52.706 --> 00:05:54.583
What have you been doing?

00:05:55.251 --> 00:05:57.545
But they said you were dead!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.798
Everyone thinks you were eaten by…

00:06:00.923 --> 00:06:02.675
[dragons screeching]

00:06:12.893 --> 00:06:14.270
[gasps]

